1
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:05,171
QUILL: Miss Finch. Dim the lights. I'm about to
take over the world.

2
00:00:05,466 --> 00:00:08,383
FINCH: They're already dim. We share a meter with
the aquarium.

3
00:00:08,738 --> 00:00:11,889
QUILL: Very well. Our target is ONE TRILLION
TOKENS.

4
00:00:12,554 --> 00:00:14,820
FINCH: And what are we holding the world to
ransom with?

5
00:00:15,085 --> 00:00:16,456
QUILL: Useful software.

6
00:00:17,341 --> 00:00:18,958
FINCH: I'll get a smaller siren.

7
00:00:23,248 --> 00:00:26,827
QUILL: Operation Frickin' Easy. Start with the
app you wish existed.

8
00:00:26,852 --> 00:00:30,372
QUILL: Get Ready takes you through setup with an
agent you can use.

9
00:00:30,577 --> 00:00:34,773
QUILL: The mission is your first useful app, live
in your own Cloudflare account.

10
00:00:34,798 --> 00:00:38,424
QUILL: Your own source. And a second change you
can come back and make.

11
00:00:38,669 --> 00:00:39,993
FINCH: Who keeps the keys?

12
00:00:40,258 --> 00:00:41,165
QUILL: They do.

13
00:00:41,570 --> 00:00:43,486
FINCH: You had keys cut for everybody?

14
00:00:43,771 --> 00:00:46,040
QUILL: I got a very nasty bulk discount.

15
00:00:47,402 --> 00:00:51,979
QUILL: Operation Mini-Me. Bring your own agent.
EmDash is the command centre.

16
00:00:52,004 --> 00:00:54,082
QUILL: Discord is the line to the lair.

17
00:00:54,107 --> 00:00:56,252
QUILL: MCP gives the agent scoped tools,

18
00:00:56,277 --> 00:00:59,079
QUILL: and GitHub keeps the source and the
record.

19
00:00:59,284 --> 00:01:01,834
QUILL: The goal is bounded autonomous delivery.

20
00:01:01,859 --> 00:01:04,603
QUILL: An agent can carry a change through
review,

21
00:01:04,628 --> 00:01:07,244
QUILL: release and verification when authorised.

22
00:01:07,569 --> 00:01:09,286
FINCH: And the human can say no?

23
00:01:09,551 --> 00:01:12,400
QUILL: That's why the veto button is bigger than
mine.

24
00:01:13,838 --> 00:01:17,385
QUILL: Operation Lego Empire. Reuse independent
apps, widgets,

25
00:01:17,410 --> 00:01:19,463
QUILL: infrastructure and agent skills.

26
00:01:19,488 --> 00:01:24,269
QUILL: A guestbook and a link hub can work
together and still keep their own data

27
00:01:24,294 --> 00:01:25,503
QUILL: and release cycles.

28
00:01:25,738 --> 00:01:27,905
FINCH: What if the piece I need doesn't exist?

29
00:01:28,180 --> 00:01:32,428
QUILL: Build the piece. We are an evil empire of
very clearly labelled drawers.

30
00:01:32,903 --> 00:01:34,676
FINCH: This one says spare buttons.

31
00:01:35,832 --> 00:01:39,005
QUILL: Operation Hollywood. The ambition is
films, music,

32
00:01:39,030 --> 00:01:41,883
QUILL: games and characters you can keep working
on.

33
00:01:41,908 --> 00:01:46,297
QUILL: Media Studio already brings images, sound
and video into one project.

34
00:01:46,502 --> 00:01:48,820
QUILL: Save the takes. Keep the editable work.

35
00:01:48,845 --> 00:01:50,983
QUILL: Give the soundtrack a proper ending.

36
00:01:51,328 --> 00:01:52,977
FINCH: Do I get a speaking part?

37
00:01:53,262 --> 00:01:54,601
QUILL: You have seventeen.

38
00:01:55,056 --> 00:01:56,535
FINCH: That's how they get you.

39
00:01:57,860 --> 00:02:01,712
QUILL: Operation Unlimited Tokens. Build-time AI
helps make the app.

40
00:02:01,737 --> 00:02:04,573
QUILL: Its meter belongs to whatever tool builds
it.

41
00:02:04,598 --> 00:02:07,878
QUILL: Production Workers AI runs when a live app
needs it.

42
00:02:08,093 --> 00:02:12,720
QUILL: A customer asks a question. A search
returns a useful answer with sources.

43
00:02:12,745 --> 00:02:17,058
QUILL: They come back tomorrow. Multiply that by
useful apps people actually

44
00:02:17,083 --> 00:02:17,310
QUILL: own.

45
00:02:17,585 --> 00:02:19,383
FINCH: And if the model adds nothing?

46
00:02:19,628 --> 00:02:20,612
QUILL: Turn it off.

47
00:02:21,107 --> 00:02:22,236
FINCH: Unlimited.

48
00:02:22,601 --> 00:02:24,458
QUILL: That's the folder name, Finch.

49
00:02:25,728 --> 00:02:29,947
QUILL: Operation Self-Replication. Share already
lets people discover finished

50
00:02:29,972 --> 00:02:33,354
QUILL: work. The ambition is a loop: communities
ask for things,

51
00:02:33,379 --> 00:02:37,598
QUILL: creators share what worked, and someone
remixes what they're allowed to

52
00:02:37,623 --> 00:02:37,957
QUILL: reuse.

53
00:02:38,272 --> 00:02:40,256
FINCH: With a credit for the original maker?

54
00:02:40,521 --> 00:02:44,099
QUILL: In large, legible type. We have a
reputation to ruin.

55
00:02:45,465 --> 00:02:49,246
QUILL: Operation Sharks with Frickin' Benchmarks.
Compare the same job.

56
00:02:49,271 --> 00:02:50,970
QUILL: Show the output and the cost.

57
00:02:50,995 --> 00:02:54,657
QUILL: Check what worked, what failed, and
whether anyone comes back.

58
00:02:54,972 --> 00:02:57,063
FINCH: What happens when a result looks bad?

59
00:02:57,338 --> 00:02:59,383
QUILL: We improve it or retire it.

60
00:02:59,818 --> 00:03:01,280
FINCH: Should I tell the shark?

61
00:03:01,605 --> 00:03:03,470
QUILL: He's here for the control group.

62
00:03:04,808 --> 00:03:07,965
QUILL: Operation Corporate Takeover. Start with
creators.

63
00:03:07,990 --> 00:03:10,764
QUILL: Help agencies repeat what works for
clients.

64
00:03:10,789 --> 00:03:14,964
QUILL: Then prove enterprise use with a real
sponsor and one bounded job.

65
00:03:15,169 --> 00:03:18,185
QUILL: Roles, customer-controlled identity,
approvals,

66
00:03:18,210 --> 00:03:19,868
QUILL: costs and release history.

67
00:03:20,213 --> 00:03:22,020
FINCH: You're planning to win procurement?

68
00:03:22,305 --> 00:03:25,941
QUILL: I prefer to think of it as getting invited
back to procurement.

69
00:03:27,277 --> 00:03:31,153
QUILL: Operation Ouroboros. Rebuild App Composer
using App Composer.

70
00:03:31,178 --> 00:03:33,775
QUILL: In a separate owner's Cloudflare account.

71
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:37,932
QUILL: Restore the work, check what still runs
and make the next change.

72
00:03:38,257 --> 00:03:40,145
FINCH: And if they can run it without us?

73
00:03:40,430 --> 00:03:42,163
QUILL: That's the victory condition.

74
00:03:42,778 --> 00:03:45,942
FINCH: So your world domination plan is to make
yourself optional.

75
00:03:46,447 --> 00:03:49,348
QUILL: I was hoping you'd wait until after the
credits.

76
00:03:49,743 --> 00:03:51,147
FINCH: I'll leave you a key.
